{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Content Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version is available up to Adamantite Technology. After defeating the Demon Lord boss, the main storyline comes to a close\u2014but your adventure doesn\u2019t end there! You can continue exploring the vast alien continent, build your camp, and enjoy free trade and restaurant management on this strange new world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/1209d01e72281feeb8a5705e44044870.avif?t=1760345589\" width=600 height=98 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore a world full of exotic alien flora and fauna. Start by mining and logging, craft advanced tools, climb the tech tree, and expand your shelter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/51737473ccfd86b4bcf039761f58c87d.poster.avif?t=1760345589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/51737473ccfd86b4bcf039761f58c87d.webm?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/51737473ccfd86b4bcf039761f58c87d.mp4?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try taming alien creatures\u2014not only to farm meat and resources, but also to ride across the planet or fight alongside you against bosses to become the alien overlord.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/58048a8a5889c2d37467f315c4edf742.poster.avif?t=1760345589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/58048a8a5889c2d37467f315c4edf742.webm?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/19d8ce67abf815748e08ecd1e0e8b1b3.avif?t=1760345589\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the alien world above, powerful monsters and bosses lurk underground. Defeat them to obtain various weapons, equipment, and materials, which can be crafted into advanced gear to make yourself stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/20524e49420ad3282e6ff425765ada22.poster.avif?t=1760345589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/20524e49420ad3282e6ff425765ada22.webm?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hundreds of weapons and accessories with distinct combat styles\u2014swords, bows, staves, hammers, and more, each with unique variations. Weapons can be upgraded and enhanced, branching into even more forms. Accessories also grant different attributes and effects, such as sprinting, dashing, or revival, allowing you to freely customize your combat style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/dbee9d6e874cc4ea0ac5d548efb2c727.poster.avif?t=1760345589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/dbee9d6e874cc4ea0ac5d548efb2c727.webm?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/fe4525116cd31811c2f3ed97a145c0b7.avif?t=1760345589\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit or capture scattered minions across the alien world. Whether farming 9-to-9-6 or mining 0-to-0-7, you can command them freely. Assign them to smelt iron, cook meals, or stock goods\u2014the planet\u2019s automation runs on the hard work of your minions. Fully enjoy the life of an alien rancher!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/25579014b31b5d2ac144518766694b44.poster.avif?t=1760345589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/25579014b31b5d2ac144518766694b44.webm?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/25579014b31b5d2ac144518766694b44.mp4?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the genes of wild creatures and use the bio-lab to create gene chips, transforming your minions into powerful weapons. This not only boosts their stats but can also change their attack patterns. Continuously upgrade and enhance your minions, leading them to conquer the planet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/32a0452523af6f9d2070949bc1f57171.poster.avif?t=1760345589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/32a0452523af6f9d2070949bc1f57171.webm?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/32a0452523af6f9d2070949bc1f57171.mp4?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/4ed9e9d6d6b42268638cc66b9b4f704e.avif?t=1760345589\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From raw materials to crafting to shelving, enjoy a full-cycle service with no middlemen taking a cut. Set up stalls to sell goods, attract merchants lining up to buy, and turn your base into the CBD of the alien world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/02f71bae39e879a43ce9de229cdf5bfb.poster.avif?t=1760345589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/02f71bae39e879a43ce9de229cdf5bfb.webm?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/02f71bae39e879a43ce9de229cdf5bfb.mp4?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personally build and run a trending restaurant, create hit dishes like \u201cBoiled Bug Jelly,\u201d offer full entertainment and lodging services, and attract merchants from across the universe\u2014experience life as an interstellar tycoon!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/65dc4722f3760fed04acbde289179c16.poster.avif?t=1760345589\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/65dc4722f3760fed04acbde289179c16.webm?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/extras/65dc4722f3760fed04acbde289179c16.mp4?t=1760345589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004010?t=1760345589","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004010?t=1760345589","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/e15934ef9a61e1566b71151c1762c51af68fe430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760345589","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004010/e15934ef9a61e1566b71151c1762c51af68fe430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760345589","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Content Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version is available up to Adamantite Technology. After defeating the Demon Lord boss, the main storyline comes to a close\u2014but your adventure doesn\u2019t end there! You can continue exploring the vast alien continent, build your camp, and enjoy free trade and restaurant management on t